      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zeyilname Raporu \u0130ndir butonuna t\u0131kland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda Y\u00FCklenmi\u015F Dosya Bulunamad\u0131 hatas\u0131 d\u00F6nmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hKZj0-YVze0Ic9LUSwJJK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17797.4269510905,
      "y": 95.26190476190436,
